fontmono=no
text=Use this settings window to enable additional action bars on screen, and to bind an action bar to a weapon style. This will automatically change your primary action bar to the relevant one. These settings can only be edited here.<br>Three action bars can be accessed by default on free worlds, six on members. You may purchase additional action bars via Solomon's General Store.<br>You may display up to five action bars on screen at the same time.
